{"id":"word:hebrew:H6051","type":"word","title":"עָנָן","subtitle":"H6051 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a cloud (as covering the sky), i.e. the nimbus or thunder-cloud","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עָנָן (H6051) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 87 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עָנָן (ʻânân) means a cloud (as covering the sky), i.e. the nimbus or thunder-cloud First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 8 10."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עָנָן","transliteration":"ʻânân","pronunciation":"aw-nawn'","strong":"H6051","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6051","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["הֶ/עָנָ֖ן","הֶֽ/עָנָן֙","עָנָ֣ן","עָנָ֖ן","הֶ/עָנָ֑ן"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncmsa",34],["HNcmsa",21],["HRd/Ncmsa",13],["HNcmsc",4],["HC/Td/Ncmsa",3],["HC/Ncmsa",3],["HC/Rd/Ncmsa",2],["HR/Ncmsc",2],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",2],["HR/Ncmpa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a cloud (as covering the sky), i.e. the nimbus or thunder-cloud","usage":"cloud(-y).","full":"H6051. anan I. עָנָן 87 noun masculine Exod 19:16 cloud-mass, cloud ; — ׳(הֶ)ע absolute 19:9 +; construct עֲנַזִ Hosea 6:4 +; suffix עֲנָֽנְךָ Num 14:14 , עֲנָנוֺ Job 26:9 ; 37:15 ; plural עֲנִים Jer 4:13 ; &#8212; 1 cloud-mass: a. especially of theophanic cloud (58 t.), chiefly at Exodus in J E (less often P), usually הֶע ׳עַמּוּד Exod 13:21-22 , + (see עַמּוּד ), but also ׳ע alone 34:5 ; compare 14:20 (J), Num 10:34 ; 11:35 ; 14:14 (all J E); ׳עַבהֶֿע Exod 19:9 , ׳ע כָּבֵד 19:16 (E); ׳ע in P 16:10 ; 24:15 23t.; also Deut 1:33 ; 4:11 ; 5:19 ; Psa 78:14 ; 105:39 ; in temple 1Kin 8:10-11 , 2Chr 5:13-14 , compare Ezek 1:4 ; 10:3-4 , hence in General Psa 97:2 , as symbol of protection Isa 4:5 ; as a barrier Lam 3:44 ; compare ׳וע רַגְלָיו אֲבַק Nahum 1:3 . b. of rain-bow cloud Gen 9:13-14 , (twice in verse); 9:16 (P), Ezek 1:28 (simile). c. עֲנַןבֹּֿקֶר Hosea 6:4 ; 13:3 (simile of transitoriness; on phenomenon in Palestine see Chaplin PEQ, 1883, 19 ), compare Isa 44:22 ; Job 7:9 (both id. ); simile of invasion Ezek 38:9 , 16 , plural Jer 4:13 . d. poetic in various connection Job 26:8-9 , 38:9 ; with אוֺר as thunder-cloud 37:11 , 15 . e. symbolic of gloom Ezek 30:18 ; 32:7 ; ע ׳יוֺם וַעֲרָפֶל Zeph 1:15 ; Ezek 34:12 ; Joel 2:2 , compare Ezek 30:3 (all of day of ׳ע ). 2 ׳ע קְטֹרֶת Lev 16:13 (P) cloud of incense , so Ezek 8:11 (strike out ᵐ5 ׳ע Co Berthol, not Toy).","rootNote":"from 6049 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 8 10","keyReferences":["1Kgs 8 10","1Kgs 8 11","2Chr 5 13","2Chr 5 14","Deut 1 33","Deut 4 11","Deut 5 22","Deut 31 15"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":87,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 8 10","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/הֶ/עָנָ֥ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Td/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 11","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הֶֽ/עָנָ֑ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 5 13","book":"2Chr","chapter":5,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עָנָ֖ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 5 14","book":"2Chr","chapter":5,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הֶ/עָנָ֑ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 1 33","book":"Deut","chapter":1,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בֶ/עָנָ֖ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Rd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 4 11","book":"Deut","chapter":4,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עָנָ֥ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 5 22","book":"Deut","chapter":5,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הֶֽ/עָנָ֣ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 31 15","book":"Deut","chapter":31,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עָנָ֑ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 31 15","book":"Deut"